  "request": "#928 w46 · status is a plain script over the run record (P3).\nProblem: `status` asks the AI to read `.spec-context.json` and summarise it. A script can print the same answer faster and the same way every time.\nProposed: Have the command run `scripts/status-context.py` and print its output, with no model summary.\nAcceptance: `/speckit.companion.status` prints the same fields as today without a model call. The script handles a missing record with one line.\nOwner: \"lets do them and reword\" (acceptance lines may be reworded to what is buildable).",
